WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.708
Both paths start with the same INT2 keys and FP8 query.

00:00:01.708 --> 00:00:04.500
The left path reconstructs FP8 K. FOSCAR builds FP4 K from the codes.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:07.542
FOSCAR folds scale and offset into the partial QK sum of 3.5.

00:00:07.542 --> 00:00:09.500
Both paths reach the same logit: −1.5.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.417
INT2 kernel speedup vs FlashInfer BF16:
3.36× on H100 and 2.67× on B200.

00:00:12.417 --> 00:00:16.000
On B200, peak serving throughput rises from 333 to 868 output tokens/s.
